WEBVTT

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:10.950
"Holy Capital"
"10 Years Ago"

00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:16.660
"Luna, Age 6" "Eagle, Age 6"

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:19.620
Come on, hurry up and run!

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:22.000
W-Wait up, Luna!

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.410
If we don't get there fast,
all the bread will be gone!

00:00:25.410 --> 00:00:28.000
I-I understand that, but...

00:00:29.410 --> 00:00:32.750
With this much, we can even buy black bread!

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:33.790
Yeah!

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:38.290
It's so frustrating...

00:00:38.290 --> 00:00:39.330
What?

00:00:42.830 --> 00:00:46.950
Someday, I'm going to eat here
every day if I want to.

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:51.870
You and I both know that's pretty impossible.

00:00:51.870 --> 00:00:56.870
You're so used to losing because
you give up before you even try!

00:00:56.870 --> 00:00:59.040
I don't know what to tell you...

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:08.540
Hey now. What are poor filthy rats
like you doing in a place like this?

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:12.450
At least use the bridge
so we won't have to look at you.

00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:18.120
This brat thinks she can snarl at us.

00:01:18.120 --> 00:01:20.910
That explains why it smells like a beast.

00:01:20.910 --> 00:01:23.500
Now my meal is completely ruined.

00:01:24.790 --> 00:01:26.950
Don't do it, Luna.

00:01:26.950 --> 00:01:29.410
I'll make you regret this.

00:01:29.410 --> 00:01:31.370
Did you say something?

00:01:31.370 --> 00:01:35.410
When I'm older, I'm lined up
to join the Holy Church.

00:01:35.410 --> 00:01:37.330
I'll become a Holy Maiden.

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:42.080
And when I do, I'll make you regret
everything you've just said to us.

00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:45.410
You've gone nuts, brat.
I've had enough of your--

00:01:45.410 --> 00:01:48.540
I would just love to get all of your names.

00:01:50.160 --> 00:01:52.620
I'm not introducing myself to rats!

00:01:53.660 --> 00:01:56.950
L-Luna! You went way too far!

00:01:58.080 --> 00:02:01.120
I refuse to lose to people like that.

00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:06.410
After all, I put in more
effort than anyone else.

00:02:15.330 --> 00:02:19.830
<i>Open your eyes</i>

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:26.370
<i>Dwelling in the eyes of</i>
<i>that majestic figure are wishes</i>

00:02:26.370 --> 00:02:29.950
<i>Let's sing to the sleepless night</i>

00:02:29.950 --> 00:02:33.290
<i>Dramatically pull everything in,</i>
<i>even light and darkness</i>

00:02:33.290 --> 00:02:36.700
<i>In order to smile again tomorrow, unafraid</i>

00:02:38.580 --> 00:02:45.500
<i>I learned that true kindness is</i>
<i>actually solitude after looking at you</i>

00:02:45.500 --> 00:02:52.000
<i>I wanted to get closer to your heart</i>
<i>and yet it's still so far away</i>

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:58.830
<i>No matter what fate gets in my way,</i>
<i>I'll face it head on</i>

00:02:58.830 --> 00:03:06.080
<i>With the bravery I chose with you,</i>
<i>let's flap our wings and fly</i>

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:11.370
<i>My heart is trembling with the hope that I found</i>

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:14.830
<i>Resounding inside me</i>
<i>move my heart</i>

00:03:14.830 --> 00:03:18.290
<i>Lurking behind my hidden true motives</i>

00:03:18.290 --> 00:03:21.750
<i>With a stronger gaze than anyone else</i>

00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:25.040
<i>Dwelling in the eyes of</i>
<i>that majestic figure are wishes</i>

00:03:25.040 --> 00:03:28.660
<i>Let's sing to the sleepless night</i>

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:31.830
<i>Dramatically pull everything in,</i>
<i>even light and darkness</i>

00:03:31.830 --> 00:03:35.410
<i>In order to smile again tomorrow, unafraid</i>

00:03:35.410 --> 00:03:37.040
<i>Let's begin</i>

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:39.040
<i>Open your eyes</i>

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:46.950
"Madam Roars"

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:50.790
"2 Years Later"
Luna Elegant.

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:51.500
You have faithfully abided
by the teachings of the Cherub,

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:54.450
You have faithfully abided
by the teachings of the Cherub,
"Luna Elegant" "Age 8"

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:56.870
put into practice all you've learned,

00:03:56.870 --> 00:04:00.580
and have reached an age
befitting of a Holy Maiden.

00:04:00.580 --> 00:04:03.790
As of today, you are to enter the Holy Church,

00:04:03.790 --> 00:04:07.040
and train to become worthy of a Holy Maiden.

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:10.750
It's with great honor that I accept.

00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:11.750
Good.

00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:18.200
I should mention that I have
a servant I'd like to bring along.

00:04:18.200 --> 00:04:19.250
I know.

00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:23.500
Oh? I'm impressed you've done
so much research about me.

00:04:23.500 --> 00:04:27.000
That individual is no longer part of our world.

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:29.000
They were executed.

00:04:34.580 --> 00:04:37.950
Research revealed they were
a demihuman, you see.

00:04:37.950 --> 00:04:41.790
To think they infiltrated the Holy Capital...

00:04:41.790 --> 00:04:44.750
A-A demihuman?

00:04:44.750 --> 00:04:49.290
B-But I know they didn't do anything bad at all!

00:04:49.290 --> 00:04:53.000
Being demihuman is a sin in itself.

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:57.870
Are you not someone who's striving
to become a Holy Maiden?

00:04:57.870 --> 00:04:59.580
That's right.

00:04:59.580 --> 00:05:08.620
In that case, you must be more
careful with whom you associate.

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:11.200
They're dead now...

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:14.870
According to the Holy Church
that follows the teachings,

00:05:14.870 --> 00:05:17.660
demihumans can never be accepted.

00:05:20.330 --> 00:05:23.830
Two years later, I became a Holy Maiden.

00:05:23.830 --> 00:05:27.000
I was allowed to use "Light"
and even "Golden" magic

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:29.330
"Luna Elegant" "Age 10"
because they saw my talent in magic.

00:05:30.410 --> 00:05:33.080
"Dona Dona"
Rabby, an impoverished village
where Bunnies blessed by the Cherub live.

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:36.580
"Kyon" "Momo"
Rabby, an impoverished village
where Bunnies blessed by the Cherub live.

00:05:41.620 --> 00:05:45.950
If I had been Lord here and had
stood at a position of power,

00:05:45.950 --> 00:05:49.000
I might have been able to prevent their death.

00:05:50.620 --> 00:05:55.700
O Cherub, please give me power...

00:05:55.700 --> 00:05:58.250
Luna... Luna...

00:05:59.410 --> 00:06:00.700
Cherub?!

00:06:01.790 --> 00:06:07.950
Cherub? You've clearly been daydreaming.
Can you hear me, Luna?

00:06:07.950 --> 00:06:11.120
--Hey, Luna.
--Oh, it was Demon Lord's voice!

00:06:11.120 --> 00:06:14.790
So? What it is it? Do you want something?

00:06:14.790 --> 00:06:16.660
You've got to be kidding me...

00:06:16.660 --> 00:06:21.910
"Hakuto Kunai" "Shrimpfry Butterfly"
Madam and I are heading your way
as planned. Are you ready for us?

00:06:21.910 --> 00:06:26.790
Of course, I was born ready!
Who do you think I am?

00:06:26.790 --> 00:06:31.790
I see. Then I guess you talking
in your sleep was just my imagination.

00:06:31.790 --> 00:06:33.540
I don't know what you mean!

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:38.750
In that case, I'm counting on you, Luna.

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:39.870
You've got it!

00:06:42.200 --> 00:06:47.290
Madam, you're about to behold the main
attraction of our hot spring resort.

00:06:47.290 --> 00:06:51.200
It's been one surprise after another
since my arrival...

00:06:51.200 --> 00:06:54.250
...and yet you say this is only the beginning.

00:06:54.250 --> 00:06:57.000
Well, you'll just have to see for yourself.

00:06:58.950 --> 00:07:02.750
Jeez, Madam! You're so slow!

00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:05.120
Come on! Hurry, hurry!

00:07:06.410 --> 00:07:10.830
My, my... You sure are a spunky one today.

00:07:10.830 --> 00:07:16.000
This is where I take my leave.
Please relax and enjoy yourself.

00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:17.870
Thank you.

00:07:17.870 --> 00:07:20.040
This way, Madam! Let's go!

00:07:21.870 --> 00:07:23.660
This is the public bath!

00:07:30.330 --> 00:07:33.450
You're telling me... all of these are baths?

00:07:36.160 --> 00:07:38.870
Let's start by washing off!

00:07:38.870 --> 00:07:44.000
My! What is this? Some sort of magic crystal?

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:45.790
It's called a shower!

00:07:47.580 --> 00:07:50.910
Allow me to wash your back, hop!

00:07:50.910 --> 00:07:57.160
It feels like all the built-up filth
is melting right off my body.

00:07:57.160 --> 00:08:02.370
Doesn't it? I don't think I could live
anymore if I didn't get to do this.

00:08:04.160 --> 00:08:06.080
I can wash your hair, bunny!

00:08:13.080 --> 00:08:15.910
We start with the shampoo to wash away grime...

00:08:15.910 --> 00:08:21.160
...and this rinse does wonders for healing
damage to the scalp and hair.

00:08:27.620 --> 00:08:32.330
We could call it a day right now
and I'd still be satisfied.

00:08:32.330 --> 00:08:34.580
Don't be silly, Madam.

00:08:34.580 --> 00:08:37.790
I haven't even begun showing off my-- I mean...

00:08:37.790 --> 00:08:40.580
There's still so much more I want to show you.

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:45.080
As usual, you're such a selfish
and straightforward girl.

00:08:45.080 --> 00:08:47.540
Come on, Madam! Hurry up!

00:08:47.540 --> 00:08:48.700
Yeah, yeah...

00:08:51.500 --> 00:08:56.290
First up is this, Madam!
It's called a carbon dioxide bath.

00:08:56.290 --> 00:08:58.950
What peculiar water this is...

00:09:00.410 --> 00:09:04.370
This is... Ah... It's so good!

00:09:04.370 --> 00:09:08.580
It almost feels like my whole body
is being set free.

00:09:08.580 --> 00:09:10.750
Oh, get this, Madam!

00:09:10.750 --> 00:09:13.870
This bath water is incredibly
good for your skin!

00:09:17.040 --> 00:09:20.410
My skin... My rough skin is gone!

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:24.000
Come on, Madam! Let's go to the next one!

00:09:25.410 --> 00:09:29.250
Huh? D-Don't run so fast, Luna!

00:09:33.250 --> 00:09:37.910
This is the herbal bath.
Doesn't it smell so nice?

00:09:37.910 --> 00:09:42.910
Are we in a forest?
It smells so refreshing in here!

00:09:47.040 --> 00:09:50.410
It's an aroma that seeps right into your skin!

00:09:53.330 --> 00:09:57.330
I see... You're very much in love too, Luna.

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:03.580
H-Huh?! What are you talking about?!

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:09.370
It's no use hiding it.
You like him, don't you? That Demon Lord...

00:10:09.370 --> 00:10:14.120
D-Don't be ridiculous! Why would I like him?!

00:10:14.120 --> 00:10:18.370
Oh, Luna, that man will be one hard nut to crack.

00:10:18.370 --> 00:10:24.700
If you don't polish up your feminine side,
he may never even look your way.

00:10:24.700 --> 00:10:29.540
U-Uh... I think we've talked enough about him!

00:10:29.540 --> 00:10:31.500
Whoa! Hold up, Luna!

00:10:34.950 --> 00:10:37.700
This is what they call a salt sauna.

00:10:37.700 --> 00:10:41.120
I'll show you exactly what to do
when you use one.

00:10:41.120 --> 00:10:43.120
Salt, you say?

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:45.950
First, you wait for a sweat to build up.

00:10:45.950 --> 00:10:52.200
And once it does, you gently rub
on the salt and coat your skin.

00:10:52.200 --> 00:10:57.080
You then wait a while and wash off
all the salt in the shower.

00:10:57.080 --> 00:10:58.700
And then repeat again!

00:11:00.120 --> 00:11:01.120
Yeah?

00:11:02.370 --> 00:11:06.410
I did this yesterday and
the results were amazing!

00:11:06.410 --> 00:11:10.160
I could practically see my
excess skin falling right off.

00:11:10.160 --> 00:11:13.200
All my old skin peeled away just like that...

00:11:13.200 --> 00:11:16.580
...and left my skin feeling smooth and reborn!

00:11:16.580 --> 00:11:20.040
It felt like I had less meat on
my stomach and thighs too!

00:11:22.290 --> 00:11:25.200
Um, what's the matter, Madam?!

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:30.250
Eek!

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:34.620
Hell yeah!

00:11:34.620 --> 00:11:36.830
Wh-What?

00:11:36.830 --> 00:11:39.830
Luna, I've made up my mind!

00:11:39.830 --> 00:11:41.040
About what?

00:11:41.950 --> 00:11:46.950
"Shrimpfry Butterfly" "Race: Human" "Sex: Female"
"Age: Unknown" "Height: Around 170cm"

00:11:46.950 --> 00:11:51.950
"Oysterfry Butterfly" "Race: Human" "Sex: Female"
"Age: Unknown" "Height: Around 170cm"

00:11:53.620 --> 00:11:56.410
Madam Shrimpfry went to
Rabby Village for a vacation?!

00:11:57.870 --> 00:12:02.080
"Angel White"
You mean he's lured in not only
our little sister, but Madam too?!

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:05.910
Queen, look at this!

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:10.410
"Killer Queen"
Hmm, vacation, huh?

00:12:10.410 --> 00:12:11.830
Who cares?

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:15.580
Hey now! Don't brush it off so easily!

00:12:15.580 --> 00:12:21.040
This means the Demon Lord has won
the favor of that Madam!

00:12:21.040 --> 00:12:27.500
Demon Lord this, Demon Lord that.
Isn't he just Luna's favorite pet?

00:12:27.500 --> 00:12:31.540
Why are you not taking this more seriously?!

00:12:31.540 --> 00:12:35.410
Because I ran into that shithead Luna in Yahoo.

00:12:35.410 --> 00:12:40.250
You should've seen the womanly
charms she was giving him.

00:12:40.250 --> 00:12:43.620
That shithead has fallen in love.

00:12:43.620 --> 00:12:47.450
Who cares about love?
This is a crisis of the kingdom!

00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:52.080
Well, you wouldn't exactly understand.

00:12:52.080 --> 00:12:55.000
Hopefully you can find love someday.

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:57.830
I'll even pray for you as a Holy Maiden.

00:12:57.830 --> 00:13:01.200
Don't talk like I'm some pitiful girl, please.

00:13:01.200 --> 00:13:04.200
I'm trying to have a serious conversation.

00:13:04.200 --> 00:13:07.910
O holy someone way up in Heaven...

00:13:07.910 --> 00:13:09.500
How's it go again?

00:13:09.500 --> 00:13:12.120
I pray my big sister isn't always unwanted.

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:18.500
Also, Mr. Zero... I love you.

00:13:18.500 --> 00:13:20.040
I adore you!

00:13:20.040 --> 00:13:22.950
You just wanted to finish with that, didn't you?

00:13:22.950 --> 00:13:24.410
Mr. Zero...

00:13:24.410 --> 00:13:26.080
There's still more?!

00:13:34.830 --> 00:13:37.330
"Isami Tahara"
Oh, it's just Tahara.

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:40.250
That "just" was unwarranted.

00:13:40.250 --> 00:13:43.160
I've been working since this morning, you know.

00:13:44.750 --> 00:13:46.750
"Yu Kirino"
Is that a map of the village?

00:13:46.750 --> 00:13:49.700
"Yu Kirino"
The facilities are placed differently though.

00:13:49.700 --> 00:13:52.080
Hmm, that's right.

00:13:52.080 --> 00:13:57.120
Are you unsatisfied with where
the Chief placed the buildings?

00:13:57.120 --> 00:14:00.540
Situations change, so locations must too.

00:14:00.540 --> 00:14:05.660
And I should mention, I already got
the Chief's permission to do this.

00:14:05.660 --> 00:14:07.870
Yeah? In that case, it's fine.

00:14:07.870 --> 00:14:14.450
You know, to think you were this devoted
to the Chief blows my mind.

00:14:14.450 --> 00:14:17.450
I just don't know what's gotten into you.

00:14:17.450 --> 00:14:21.120
More like, have you changed
your hobbies up or something?

00:14:22.410 --> 00:14:28.080
--When it comes to you, I always thought
you were a hardcore little boy lover.
--Little boy Aku, little boy Luna,
little boy Tron! It's too much!

00:14:28.080 --> 00:14:31.120
There's so many Bunny brats
for you to choose from too.

00:14:33.120 --> 00:14:37.540
Lately, no other guys but
the Chief even enter my mind.

00:14:37.540 --> 00:14:39.040
Is that right?

00:14:39.040 --> 00:14:43.370
Please, stay as you are.
Stay sweet like this forever...

00:14:43.370 --> 00:14:45.790
...for the sake of this world.

00:14:45.790 --> 00:14:49.750
In any case, it looks like you're
changing a whole lot of things.

00:14:49.750 --> 00:14:51.540
Yeah, kinda.

00:14:51.540 --> 00:14:56.250
I'm thinking about dividing it up into
sections that serve different purposes.

00:14:56.250 --> 00:14:58.120
Sort of like so...

00:14:58.120 --> 00:15:03.620
Medical section, business section,
commoner section, and Bunny section.

00:15:03.620 --> 00:15:06.790
Sounds like it'll take a lot of money.

00:15:06.790 --> 00:15:12.790
About that... We'd be exchanging your
holy coin thing for all that we need.

00:15:12.790 --> 00:15:16.580
Yeah? I'm so glad my work came in handy!

00:15:16.580 --> 00:15:21.580
I know. Chief was really happy,
saying you'll be a great source of revenue.

00:15:24.330 --> 00:15:27.790
Please, let her stay sweet like this forever...

00:15:27.790 --> 00:15:30.250
Seriously. I'm begging you.

00:15:30.250 --> 00:15:32.540
But, I'm thinking...

00:15:32.540 --> 00:15:38.080
If you're changing things up this much,
why not ask Madam's opinion?

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:39.870
I refuse.

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:43.870
Listen, you might say that this is our castle.

00:15:43.870 --> 00:15:46.750
Madam gets no say in what we do.

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:51.040
I'm not letting some noble
dictate what we do in our territory.

00:15:51.040 --> 00:15:53.660
It sets a dangerous precedent.

00:15:53.660 --> 00:15:55.580
Yu...

00:15:55.580 --> 00:15:58.370
...are you that stupid?

00:15:58.370 --> 00:15:59.500
I'll kill you.

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:03.540
Did you forget the Nightless City incident?

00:16:06.330 --> 00:16:10.580
I'm sorry. It was a careless remark.

00:16:10.580 --> 00:16:16.620
Though Chief said he's going the
opposite direction as the Great Empire.

00:16:16.620 --> 00:16:21.620
He did. He also said going down
that same path would be boring.

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:24.370
Yu, are you fine with that?

00:16:26.080 --> 00:16:28.500
The thing about me, Tahara...

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:30.910
I was touched by the world's fault.

00:16:30.910 --> 00:16:34.160
There you go again with the crazy talk.

00:16:34.160 --> 00:16:38.500
What's more, I can feel the presence
of God within the Chief.

00:16:43.040 --> 00:16:44.790
What the hell?

00:16:44.790 --> 00:16:49.370
What's it you say?
Unlocking the mysteries of the body or something?

00:16:49.370 --> 00:16:53.410
Is this a new favorite saying
to replace the old one?

00:16:53.410 --> 00:16:55.830
No, it's not.

00:16:55.830 --> 00:16:59.540
As time goes on, that feeling
only gets stronger.

00:16:59.540 --> 00:17:02.330
Can't you vaguely sense it's true?

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:14.450
I'm pretty sure I'm as healthy
as it gets, but...

00:17:14.450 --> 00:17:19.700
Don't say that. Everyone should get
regular checkups just in case.

00:17:19.700 --> 00:17:22.750
And it would be awful if
something happened to you.

00:17:22.750 --> 00:17:24.540
Well, I suppose...

00:17:31.830 --> 00:17:34.410
I-I think I'm done here.

00:17:34.410 --> 00:17:37.580
I'll just come and see you when I feel sick.

00:17:37.580 --> 00:17:40.700
Huh? You mustn't go, Chief.

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:42.950
Your examination isn't over yet.

00:17:44.870 --> 00:17:47.830
Ah, your chest is so hot to the touch...

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:51.330
And so hard... and manly...

00:17:51.330 --> 00:17:55.750
L-Let's wrap it up. I've got to get
started with some other work.

00:17:55.750 --> 00:17:57.660
We can continue this later.

00:17:57.660 --> 00:17:59.580
Aww, Chief!

00:18:25.410 --> 00:18:27.080
This is where it's at...

00:18:30.200 --> 00:18:33.620
An outdoor bath in a fantasy world...

00:18:33.620 --> 00:18:35.790
I found you.

00:18:35.790 --> 00:18:40.040
It's the runt! What the hell
are you doing here?!

00:18:40.040 --> 00:18:42.040
You worked hard all today.

00:18:42.040 --> 00:18:45.200
"Tron"
Let me wash that long hair of yours.

00:18:46.080 --> 00:18:49.370
This here's the men's bath, runt!

00:18:49.370 --> 00:18:52.870
I'm not a runt. My name is Tron.

00:18:54.750 --> 00:18:59.660
What would Yu or Luna say if they saw this?
Hurry up and leave!

00:18:59.660 --> 00:19:02.250
And at least wear a towel!

00:19:02.250 --> 00:19:05.290
I don't mind being seen by Zero.

00:19:05.290 --> 00:19:09.750
I'm not Zero! And don't ever call me
that with people around!

00:19:13.620 --> 00:19:18.870
All right. What I just saw will be
a secret between Zero and me.

00:19:18.870 --> 00:19:22.250
Enough about Zero.
Head to the women's bath already.

00:19:26.410 --> 00:19:29.040
Oh, my...

00:19:34.160 --> 00:19:37.410
Well, it's no surprise the TV doesn't work.

00:19:41.370 --> 00:19:45.830
If this were the same as the game,
the dining room would be stocked...

00:19:45.830 --> 00:19:50.450
...and steamed buns would
automatically be put in the rooms.

00:19:50.450 --> 00:19:53.410
I guess we're out of luck as far
as food is concerned.

00:19:55.080 --> 00:19:59.450
Though, the consumables are being
replenished all on their own,

00:19:59.450 --> 00:20:01.910
so it's not like everything's a bust.

00:20:09.450 --> 00:20:14.160
"Aku"
Demon Lord! This hot spring resort is really amazing!

00:20:14.160 --> 00:20:16.790
The water, the baths, everything!

00:20:16.790 --> 00:20:18.500
Calm down, Aku.

00:20:18.500 --> 00:20:22.200
I went in the one called an herbal bath today!

00:20:22.200 --> 00:20:23.580
Mmm?

00:20:23.580 --> 00:20:26.580
It's true, you do smell sweet like herbs.

00:20:26.580 --> 00:20:27.830
Really?

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:31.410
Are you sleeping with me again?

00:20:38.450 --> 00:20:43.580
Aku! Didn't I say you had to be
my body pillow today?!

00:20:43.580 --> 00:20:46.540
If you're looking for Aku,
she's sleeping with me.

00:20:46.540 --> 00:20:48.700
Y-You pervert!

00:20:48.700 --> 00:20:51.250
What do you plan on doing to her?

00:20:51.250 --> 00:20:57.000
I don't know what you're imagining,
but I'm sure your head is in naughty places.

00:21:04.910 --> 00:21:10.500
S-Since you leave me no choice,
I guess I'll have to sleep here tonight too.

00:21:10.500 --> 00:21:15.410
How can this bed be so incredibly soft?
It's unbelievable...

00:21:18.540 --> 00:21:23.700
H-Hey! Y-You just touched my butt, didn't you?!

00:21:23.700 --> 00:21:26.910
How many times are you
going to falsely accuse me?

00:21:28.250 --> 00:21:30.910
I-It's no use denying it.

00:21:30.910 --> 00:21:34.160
I-I'll have to keep watch
on this bad hand of yours.

00:21:34.160 --> 00:21:35.580
Hey now...

00:21:37.200 --> 00:21:42.290
I-It's pretty hard, isn't it?
And your veins are throbbing...

00:21:42.290 --> 00:21:45.750
Would you stop saying things
that sound all wrong?

00:21:59.000 --> 00:22:01.700
<i>"I wish I could go back"</i>

00:22:01.700 --> 00:22:04.410
<i>Is what someone said</i>

00:22:04.410 --> 00:22:09.200
<i>But I don't have a past</i>

00:22:09.200 --> 00:22:12.200
<i>For eternity</i>

00:22:12.200 --> 00:22:14.700
<i>That nothing would change</i>

00:22:14.700 --> 00:22:19.450
<i>Is what I thought</i>

00:22:19.450 --> 00:22:22.250
<i>Over and over </i>

00:22:22.250 --> 00:22:25.580
<i>Rubbing my eyes to make sure</i>

00:22:25.580 --> 00:22:29.660
<i>I'm overwhelmed by emotion</i>

00:22:29.660 --> 00:22:32.910
<i>Like a lie</i>
<i>Bright! Still locked up</i>

00:22:32.910 --> 00:22:35.790
<i>Hiding what I couldn't give up</i>

00:22:35.790 --> 00:22:39.950
<i>That miracle lit up by my heart</i>

00:22:39.950 --> 00:22:43.160
<i>Not sought out, not doubted</i>

00:22:43.160 --> 00:22:46.120
<i>But still you believed</i>

00:22:46.120 --> 00:22:50.540
<i>As if to teach me</i>

00:22:50.540 --> 00:22:56.370
<i>RE NEW ME</i>
<i>Now that I'm laughing with you</i>

00:22:56.370 --> 00:23:03.290
<i>I can embrace it all</i>

00:23:03.290 --> 00:23:09.040
<i>Once again</i>

00:23:17.540 --> 00:23:18.700
Demon Lord!

00:23:18.700 --> 00:23:21.750
Hmm? Got a cold, Aku? Your voice...

00:23:21.750 --> 00:23:24.450
Ugh, I'm the same way...

00:23:24.450 --> 00:23:25.660
Tron too.

00:23:25.660 --> 00:23:28.500
Anyways, why are the
three of you wearing shorts?

00:23:28.500 --> 00:23:34.700
Ch-Chief. Just this once,
would you let me turn you into a little boy?

00:23:34.700 --> 00:23:37.410
Little boy, little boy,
little boy, little boy...

00:23:37.410 --> 00:23:38.620
Little boy!

00:23:38.620 --> 00:23:41.200
W-Was that a dream?

00:23:41.200 --> 00:23:46.160
Next time: <i>Demon Lord, Retry</i>
Episode 11. "Yukikaze Attacks."
